xt-[rgba(214,249,221,0.62)] transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer bg-transparent border-none hover:text-[#D6F9DD] hover:bg-[rgba(153,247,171,0.06)]\">skills</button><button class=\"capitalize px-4 py-2 rounded-md text-[0.72rem] tracking-[0.06em] uppercase font-[family-name:var(--font-mono)] text-[rgba(214,249,221,0.62)] transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer bg-transparent border-none hover:text-[#D6F9DD] hover:bg-[rgba(153,247,171,0.06)]\">projects</button><button class=\"capitalize px-4 py-2 rounded-md text-[0.72rem] tracking-[0.06em] uppercase font-[family-name:var(--font-mono)] text-[rgba(214,249,221,0.62)] transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer bg-transparent border-none hover:text-[#D6F9DD] hover:bg-[rgba(153,247,171,0.06)]\">contact</button></div><button class=\"hidden md:inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-[22px] py-[9px] rounded-md text-[0.72rem] font-medium tracking-[0.06em] uppercase font-[family-name:var(--font-mono)] bg-[#99F7AB] text-[#111f26] transition-all duration-200 hover:opacity-[0.88] hover:-translate-y-[1px] cursor-pointer border-none\">Hire Me</button><button class=\"md:hidden flex flex-col gap-[5px] cursor-pointer p-[6px] bg-transparent border-none\" aria-label=\"Toggle menu\"><span class=\"block w-[22px] h-[1.5px] rounded-[1px] bg-[#D6F9DD] transition-all duration-300\" style=\"transform:none\"></span><span class=\"block w-[22px] h-[1.5px] rounded-[1px] bg-[#D6F9DD] transition-all duration-300\" style=\"opacity:1\"></span><span class=\"block w-[22px] h-[1.5px] rounded-[1px] bg-[#D6F9DD] transition-all duration-300\" style=\"transform:none\"></span></button></div></nav><main><section id=\"hero-section\" class=\"min-h-svh flex items-center relative overflow-hidden\" style=\"padding:calc(72px + 60px) 0 80px\"><div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-[1120px] mx-auto px-5 md:px-[60px] w-full\"><div class=\"grid gap-[80px] items-center\" style=\"grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr))\"><div><div class=\"reveal inline-flex items-center gap-[10px] mb-7 px-4 py-[7px] rounded-[4px] text-[0.7rem] tracking-[0.1em] uppercase\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-mono);color:#99F7AB;background:var(--accent-dim);border:1px solid var(--glass-border)\"><span class=\"w-[6px] h-[6px] rounded-full bg-[#99F7AB] animate-blink\"></span>Available for Work  ·  Dhaka, Bangladesh</div><h1 class=\"reveal reveal-delay-1 leading-[1.0] tracking-[-0.02em] font-bold mb-6\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(3rem,6.5vw,5.6rem);color:#D6F9DD\">I build<br/>interfaces that<br/><em style=\"color:#99F7AB;font-style:italic\">perform.</em></h1><p class=\"reveal reveal-delay-2 text-[1.02rem] leading-[1.8] max-w-[500px] mb-10\" style=\"color:rgba(214,249,221,0.62);font-family:var(--font-body)\">I&#x27;m <strong style=\"color:#D6F9DD;font-weight:700\">Tanvir Hassan</strong> — a frontend developer specialising in React and Next.js, crafting responsive, accessible, and high-performance web experiences that users genuinely enjoy.</p><div class=\"reveal reveal-delay-3 flex flex-wrap gap-[14px] mb-12\"><a href=\"#projects\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-7 py-[13px] rounded-md font-medium text-[0.78rem] tracking-[0.04em] uppercase transition-all duration-200 hover:opacity-[0.88] hover:-translate-y-[2px]\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-mono);background:#99F7AB;color:#111f26\">View Projects →</a><a href=\"/assets/resume.pdf\" download=\"Tanvir-Hassan-Resume.pdf\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-7 py-[13px] rounded-md text-[0.78rem] tracking-[0.04em] uppercase transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-[2px]\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-mono);background:transparent;border:1px solid #99F7AB;color:#99F7AB\">⬇ Download CV</a></div></div><div class=\"max-w-100 w-full mx-auto lg:mx-0\"><div class=\"relative w-full rounded-sm overflow-hidden\" style=\"aspect-ratio:4/5;background:#1e3c47;border:1px solid var(--glass-border)\"><img alt=\"Tanvir Hassan — Frontend Developer\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover object-top\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"w-full\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhehe.jpeg&amp;w=16&amp;q=75 16w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhehe.jpeg&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 32w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhehe.jpeg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 48w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhehe.jpeg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 64w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhehe.jpeg&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 96w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhehe.jpeg&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 128w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhehe.jpeg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhehe.jpeg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhehe.jpeg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhehe.jpeg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhehe.jpeg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhehe.jpeg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhehe.jpeg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhehe.jpeg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhehe.jpeg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhehe.jpeg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhehe.jpeg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 55%, rgba(17,31,38,0.75))\"></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"about\" class=\"py-[clamp(80px,11vw,130px)]\"><div class=\"max-w-[1120px] mx-auto px-5 md:px-[60px]\"><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-20 items-center\"><div><div class=\"reveal mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[0.68rem] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] font-[family-name:var(--font-mono)] text-[#99F7AB]\"><span class=\"text-[rgba(214,249,221,0.32)]\">—</span>About Me</div><h2 class=\"reveal reveal-delay-1 font-bold leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.02em] mb-4 font-[family-name:var(--font-display)] text-[clamp(2.2rem,4.5vw,3.4rem)] text-[#D6F9DD]\">Developer,<br/>not just a coder.</h2><div class=\"reveal reveal-delay-2 space-y-5 text-[1rem] leading-[1.85] text-[rgba(214,249,221,0.62)]\"><p>I&#x27;m<!-- --> <strong class=\"font-bold text-[#D6F9DD]\">Tanvir Hassan</strong>, a frontend developer from Dhaka, Bangladesh who genuinely loves building things for the web. What started with curiosity about a few lines of HTML has grown into a craft I care deeply about.</p><p>I specialize in the<!-- --> <strong class=\"font-bold text-[#D6F9DD]\">React and Next.js ecosystem</strong>, focusing on component-driven architecture that&#x27;s clean, scalable, and accessible. I care about the details — performance, Core Web Vitals, code that&#x27;s actually maintainable.</p><p>These days I&#x27;m<!-- --> <strong class=\"font-bold text-[#D6F9DD]\">expanding into full-stack</strong> <!-- -->with the MERN stack, and I&#x27;m enjoying every bit of that journey.</p><p>When I&#x27;m not at the keyboard, you&#x27;ll probably find me on the<!-- --> <strong class=\"font-bold text-[#D6F9DD]\">football pitch</strong>. That same team-first, keep-pushing mindset is something I carry into my work too.</p></div></div><div class=\"reveal reveal-delay-3 flex flex-col gap-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 px-6 py-5 rounded-md cursor-default transition-all duration-300 hover:translate-x-[5px] hover:border-[rgba(153,247,171,0.25)] border border-[rgba(153,247,171,0.14)] backdrop-blur-[16px] bg-[rgba(153,247,171,0.06)]\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 shrink-0 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center text-[1.1rem] bg-[rgba(153,247,171,0.18)] border border-[rgba(153,247,171,0.14)]\">⚡</div><div><div class=\"font-bold text-[0.88rem] mb-1 text-[#D6F9DD]\">Performance-first mindset</div><div class=\"text-[0.65rem] font-[family-name:var(--font-mono)] text-[rgba(214,249,221,0.32)]\">Core Web Vitals · Lighthouse · Bundle analysis</div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 px-6 py-5 rounded-md cursor-default transition-all duration-300 hover:translate-x-[5px] hover:border-[rgba(153,247,171,0.25)] border border-[rgba(153,247,171,0.14)] backdrop-blur-[16px] bg-[rgba(153,247,171,0.06)]\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 shrink-0 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center text-[1.1rem] bg-[rgba(153,247,171,0.18)] border border-[rgba(153,247,171,0.14)]\">♿</div><div><div class=\"font-bold text-[0.88rem] mb-1 text-[#D6F9DD]\">Accessibility by default</div><div class=\"text-[0.65rem] font-[family-name:var(--font-mono)] text-[rgba(214,249,221,0.32)]\">WCAG 2.1 · Semantic HTML · Keyboard nav</div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 px-6 py-5 rounded-md cursor-default transition-all duration-300 hover:translate-x-[5px] hover:border-[rgba(153,247,171,0.25)] border border-[rgba(153,247,171,0.14)] backdrop-blur-[16px] bg-[rgba(153,247,171,0.06)]\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 shrink-0 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center text-[1.1rem] bg-[rgba(153,247,171,0.18)] border border-[rgba(153,247,171,0.14)]\">📱</div><div><div class=\"font-bold text-[0.88rem] mb-1 text-[#D6F9DD]\">Truly responsive design</div><div class=\"text-[0.65rem] font-[family-name:var(--font-mono)] text-[rgba(214,249,221,0.32)]\">Mobile-first · All viewports · Touch-friendly</div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 px-6 py-5 rounded-md cursor-default transition-all duration-300 hover:translate-x-[5px] hover:border-[rgba(153,247,171,0.25)] border border-[rgba(153,247,171,0.14)] backdrop-blur-[16px] bg-[rgba(153,247,171,0.06)]\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 shrink-0 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center text-[1.1rem] bg-[rgba(153,247,171,0.18)] border border-[rgba(153,247,171,0.14)]\">🎨</div><div><div class=\"font-bold text-[0.88rem] mb-1 text-[#D6F9DD]\">Design sensibility</div><div class=\"text-[0.65rem] font-[family-name:var(--font-mono)] text-[rgba(214,249,221,0.32)]\">Figma · Design systems · Component tokens</div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 px-6 py-5 rounded-md cursor-default transition-all duration-300 hover:translate-x-[5px] hover:border-[rgba(153,247,171,0.25)] border border-[rgba(153,247,171,0.14)] backdrop-blur-[16px] bg-[rgba(153,247,171,0.06)]\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 shrink-0 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center text-[1.1rem] bg-[rgba(153,247,171,0.18)] border border-[rgba(153,247,171,0.14)]\">🚀</div><div><div class=\"font-bold text-[0.88rem] mb-1 text-[#D6F9DD]\">Growing into full-stack</div><div class=\"text-[0.65rem] font-[family-name:var(--font-mono)] text-[rgba(214,249,221,0.32)]\">MERN Stack · Node.js · Express · MongoDB</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"education\" class=\"py-[clamp(80px,11vw,130px)]\"><div class=\"max-w-[1120px] mx-auto px-5 md:px-[60px]\"><div class=\"text-center mb-14\"><div class=\"reveal inline-flex items-center gap-[10px] mb-[18px] text-[0.68rem] tracking-[0.14em] uppercase\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-mono);color:#99F7AB\"><span style=\"color:rgba(214,249,221,0.32)\">—</span> Education</div><h2 class=\"reveal reveal-delay-1 font-bold leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.02em]\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(2.2rem,4.5vw,3.4rem);color:#D6F9DD\">Academic background.</h2></div><div class=\"reveal reveal-delay-2 flex flex-col gap-[22px]\"><div class=\"relative p-5 sm:p-7 rounded-md transition-all duration-200\" style=\"background:var(--glass);border:1px solid var(--glass-border);backdrop-filter:blur(20px)\"><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:gap-8\"><div class=\"text-[0.7rem] tracking-[0.04em] mb-3 sm:mb-0 sm:pt-1 sm:min-w-[160px] sm:max-w-[160px]\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-mono);color:#99F7AB\">2022 — Present</div><div class=\"flex-1\"><h3 class=\"font-bold mb-1 text-[1.05rem] sm:text-[1.2rem]\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);color:#D6F9DD\">B.Sc. in Computer Science &amp; Engineering</h3><div class=\"text-[0.75rem] tracking-[0.04em] mb-[10px]\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-mono);color:#99F7AB\">Currently Pursuing · Dhaka, Bangladesh</div><p class=\"text-[0.85rem] sm:text-[0.9rem] leading-[1.75]\" style=\"color:rgba(214,249,221,0.62)\">Studying computer science fundamentals including data structures, algorithms, databases, software engineering, and computer networks. Supplementing coursework with hands-on web development projects to bridge theory and practice — building real-world applications that apply what I learn in the classroom.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"skills\" class=\"py-[clamp(80px,11vw,130px)]\"><div class=\"max-w-[1120px] mx-auto px-5 md:px-[60px]\"><div class=\"text-center mb-14\"><div class=\"reveal inline-flex items-center gap-[10px] mb-[18px] text-[0.68rem] tracking-[0.14em] uppercase\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-mono);color:#99F7AB\"><span style=\"color:rgba(214,249,221,0.32)\">—</span> Technical Skills</div><h2 class=\"reveal reveal-delay-1 font-bold leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.02em] mb-4\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(2.2rem,4.5vw,3.4rem);color:#D6F9DD\">Tools I trust.</h2><p class=\"reveal reveal-delay-2 text-[1rem] leading-[1.75] max-w-[540px] mx-auto\" style=\"color:rgba(214,249,221,0.62)\">A curated stack — every tool here is one I use with confidence in production.</p></div><div class=\"grid gap-[22px] sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"reveal reveal-delay-1 relative p-[30px] rounded-md overflow-hidden transition-all duration-[280ms] skill-card-line\" style=\"background:var(--glass);border:1px solid var(--glass-border);backdrop-filter:blur(20px)\"><div class=\"text-[0.64rem] tracking-[0.12em] uppercase mb-[10px]\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-mono);color:#99F7AB\">Core Stack</div><h3 class=\"font-bold mb-[18px]\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.3rem;color:#D6F9DD\">Frontend</h3><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-[7px]\"><span class=\"tag\">HTML5</span><span class=\"tag\">CSS3</span><span class=\"tag\">JavaScript</span><span class=\"tag\">TypeScript</span><span class=\"tag\">React.js</span><span class=\"tag\">Next.js</span><span class=\"tag\">Tailwind CSS</span><span class=\"tag\">DaisyUI</span></div></div><div class=\"reveal reveal-delay-2 relative p-[30px] rounded-md overflow-hidden transition-all duration-[280ms] skill-card-line\" style=\"background:var(--glass);border:1px solid var(--glass-border);backdrop-filter:blur(20px)\"><div class=\"text-[0.64rem] tracking-[0.12em] uppercase mb-[10px]\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-mono);color:#99F7AB\">Backend &amp; Database</div><h3 class=\"font-bold mb-[18px]\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.3rem;color:#D6F9DD\">Backend</h3><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-[7px]\"><span class=\"tag\">Node.js</span><span class=\"tag\">Express.js</span><span class=\"tag\">MongoDB</span><span class=\"tag\">MySQL</span><span class=\"tag\">REST API</span><span class=\"tag\">JWT</span><span class=\"tag\">Better Auth</span></div></div><div class=\"reveal reveal-delay-3 relative p-[30px] rounded-md overflow-hidden transition-all duration-[280ms] skill-card-line\" style=\"background:var(--glass);border:1px solid var(--glass-border);backdrop-filter:blur(20px)\"><div class=\"text-[0.64rem] tracking-[0.12em] uppercase mb-[10px]\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-mono);color:#99F7AB\">Tools &amp; Design</div><h3 class=\"font-bold mb-[18px]\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.3rem;color:#D6F9DD\">Tooling</h3><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-[7px]\"><span class=\"tag\">Git</span><span class=\"tag\">GitHub</span><span class=\"tag\">Figma</span><span class=\"tag\">Vercel</span><span class=\"tag\">Netlify</span><span class=\"tag\">Vite</span><span class=\"tag\">Webpack</span><span class=\"tag\">Postman</span></div></div><div class=\"reveal reveal-delay-1 relative p-[30px] rounded-md overflow-hidden transition-all duration-[280ms] skill-card-line\" style=\"background:var(--glass);border:1px solid var(--glass-border);backdrop-filter:blur(20px)\"><div class=\"text-[0.64rem] tracking-[0.12em] uppercase mb-[10px]\" style=\"font-